<div class="wrap">
  <header class="head">
    <h1>register <span class="path">· __TITLE__</span></h1>
    <span class="gen">generated by · register render</span>
    <p class="sub">A view of <code>DEVIATIONS.md</code>: one row per entry, built from its header line. Filter with the chips (any chip in a row; every row of chips at once), search by number, title or citing file, click an entry for its sources and the files that cite it. The reasoning lives in the Markdown; this page is read-only and regenerated by <code>register render</code>.</p>
  </header>

  <div id="chips"></div>
